From 938e73e3a478b1eec32a64d0600a797fa8c511b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gearhead <ys3al35l@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:35:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] mixer/pipewire: add sink volume mixer

Add a mixer plugin that controls the volume of the PipeWire sink
directly, so MPD's volume setting is applied at the sink instead of in
software. Like the ALSA hardware mixer, this avoids scaling samples in
MPD and keeps the PCM data unmodified to the sink.
